==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that almost any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. The only minor threat of this level is a simple Gory Dark, which can be beaten by simply protecting generalist ranged units.

==Trivia==
*Bug Squashing's Japanese name, Hypermedia Creator, is also known for being the title held by Japanese DJ, filmmaker and writer [[wikipedia:Tsuyoshi Takashiro|Tsuyoshi Takashiro]] when he appeared on TV.

